      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe this is a very important thing to take into consideration, especially since there seems to be a whole network of malicious people abusing the system.\n\nI don't know much about crasher avatars myself, but it's true their effects impacted vrchat public lobbies quite a lot, along side rippers and general unpleasant users, generally giving public lobbies a very poor reputation, and seeing actions taken to properly disrupt malicious users would be a very well recieved.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
