      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The SDK issues in bug reports that allow these avatars to be made in the first place should probably be prioritized to. Several have existed for years now and haven't even been marked as 'interested' let alone put into any sort of state of priority. Instead we just get camera bullshit.",
